@k.words.ibrahim.noun.1 k.words.sense word=Ibrahim pos=noun n=1 gloss="the first of the Old Testament patriarchs and the father of Isaac; according to Genesis, God promised to give Abraham's family (the Hebrews) the land of Canaan (the Promised Land); God tested Abraham by asking him to sacrifice his son" synonym=Abraham instance_of=patriarch core.source="wordnet 3.1"
